-zhao-family-witness:p001","quote":"倫之大喜，每載酒肴詣泰。五年，卒。子伯符嗣。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p001:m0018","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p001:m0000","source_term":"子伯符嗣"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-song046-zhao-bofu-father","parent_person_id":"r5n_x7v_cwf_AC"}},{"id":"r5n_x7v_cwf_ACA*A","label":"趙勗（趙伯符孫）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"勗","mention_ids":["c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0106","c-songshu-046-zhaoxu-complete:p001:m0004"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0106","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness","quote":"勗"},{"mention_id":"c-songshu-046-zhaoxu-complete:p001:m0004","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-zhaoxu-complete:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-zhaoxu-complete","quote":"勗"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-046","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-zhaoxu-complete","source_id":"s-songshu-046-zhaoxu-complete-ws2118581","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-zhaoxu-complete:p001","quote":"孫","kind":"person_reference","mention_id":"c-songshu-046-zhaoxu-complete:p001:r0003"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"趙勗（趙伯符孫），見本組原文及身份互校。","family_path":{"connection":"grandfather","generation_distance":2,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"伯符孫勗，未載所自之子，不補倩為父。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-046","chapter_id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness","source_id":"s-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness-ws2118581","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003","quote":"典筆吏取筆不如意，鞭五十。子倩，尚文帝第四女海鹽公主。初，始興王濬以潘妃之寵，故得出入後宮，遂與公主私通。及適倩，倩入宮而怒，肆詈搏擊，引絕帳帶。事上聞，有詔離婚，殺主所生蔣美人，伯符慚懼發病卒。諡曰肅。傳國至孫勗，齊受禪，國除。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0106","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-046-zhao-family-witness:p003:m0090","source_term":"傳國至孫勗"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-song046-zhao